{"seq":1,"slug":"leg-mechanisms-gait","title":"腿足机构与步态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/legged/leg-mechanisms-gait","wordCount":1826,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"腿足机构与步态\">腿足机构与步态</h1><p>观察一匹马从慢步加速到飞奔，你会看到它的腿在某些速度下两两同步、在另一些速度下依次落地——这不是随意切换，而是能量与稳定性共同挑选出的最优落足节律。腿足机器人要把这套生物学直觉变成可计算的机构设计与步态序列。本篇是腿足章的入口，专管两件事：腿的机械拓扑怎么决定它能产生什么力，以及步态如何用时间编排多条腿的着地与摆动。动态平衡的判据留给 <a href=\"balance-dynamic-stability\">平衡与动态稳定</a>，具体控制器留给 <a href=\"biped-quadruped-control\">双足与四足控制</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一条腿要做两件事：<strong>支撑</strong>身体并对地面施力，<strong>摆动</strong>到下一个落足点。机构设计决定了这两件事的力学品质——腿的连杆构型决定工作空间与可输出力的方向，驱动方式决定它能多快响应地面冲击。步态则是更高一层的时间编排：哪些腿在何时着地（支撑相）、何时离地（摆动相）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[腿足运动] --&gt; B[机构层]&#10;  A --&gt; C[步态层]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[串联腿&lt;br/&gt;工作空间大]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[并联/缩放腿&lt;br/&gt;刚度高 惯量低]&#10;  B --&gt; B3[驱动: 高减速比 vs 准直驱]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[静态步态&lt;br/&gt;慢 始终稳定]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[动态步态&lt;br/&gt;快 间歇失稳]&#10;  C1 --&gt; D[占空比 / 相位 / 摆动序列]&#10;  C2 --&gt; D\">flowchart TD\n  A[腿足运动] --&gt; B[机构层]\n  A --&gt; C[步态层]\n  B --&gt; B1[串联腿&lt;br/&gt;工作空间大]\n  B --&gt; B2[并联/缩放腿&lt;br/&gt;刚度高 惯量低]\n  B --&gt; B3[驱动: 高减速比 vs 准直驱]\n  C --&gt; C1[静态步态&lt;br/&gt;慢 始终稳定]\n  C --&gt; C2[动态步态&lt;br/&gt;快 间歇失稳]\n  C1 --&gt; D[占空比 / 相位 / 摆动序列]\n  C2 --&gt; D</pre><p>下表对比几种典型四足步态，量化&quot;为什么速度上去就要换步态&quot;。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步态</th>\n<th>同时支撑腿数</th>\n<th>占空比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>速度区间</th>\n<th>稳定性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>爬行 crawl</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.75</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;0.75</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.75</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>静态稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对角小跑 trot</td>\n<td>2（对角）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>动态稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>踱步 pace</td>\n<td>2（同侧）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>易侧倾</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跳跃 bound/gallop</td>\n<td>0-2</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>含腾空相</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"腿的机械拓扑与驱动\">腿的机械拓扑与驱动</h2><p>腿的连杆构型直接决定它的&quot;性格&quot;。<strong>串联腿</strong>（髋-膝-踝逐级串接）工作空间大、结构直观，是多数四足与人形的选择，但远端关节要驱动整条腿的惯量，响应受限。<strong>并联或缩放型机构</strong>（如把电机集中在髋部、用连杆把运动传到膝/踝）能大幅降低腿的转动惯量、提高带宽，代价是工作空间和可达姿态受限——许多高动态四足正是用这种&quot;近端集中驱动&quot;换取快速摆腿。</p>\n<p>驱动方式是另一条主线。传统工业关节用高减速比谐波减速器，力矩大但<strong>透明度（backdrivability）<strong>差，难以感知和顺应外力。现代高动态腿足偏好</strong>准直驱（quasi-direct-drive）</strong>：低减速比+大扭矩电机，关节可反向驱动，能像弹簧一样吸收落地冲击，并用电机电流直接估计关节力矩——这为后续 <a href=\"../control/force-compliant-locomotion\">力控与柔顺运动</a> 的力控提供了硬件基础。此外，串联弹性驱动（SEA）在电机与负载间插入弹性元件，缓冲冲击、保护减速器，但牺牲了控制带宽。</p>\n<h2 id=\"步态参数化-占空比-相位与摆动轨迹\">步态参数化：占空比、相位与摆动轨迹</h2><p>把步态写成可计算的对象，靠三组参数。<strong>占空比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span></strong> 是单腿支撑时间占整个步态周期的比例，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta &gt; 0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> 意味着任意时刻至少有部分腿同时着地，倾向静态稳定；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta &lt; 0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> 则出现腾空，必属动态步态。<strong>相位偏移</strong>规定各腿在周期中的先后：对角小跑里对角两腿同相、相邻腿差半周期，所以 trot 总是对角成对落地。<strong>摆动轨迹</strong>则规划腿离地后如何抬起、前移、落下，常用贝塞尔曲线或摆线生成抬脚高度可调的轨迹，以越过障碍又不浪费能量。</p>\n<p>落足点本身也要计算。一个被广泛使用的启发式是 Raibert 落足点法则，把落足点放在与速度成比例的位置以维持平衡，其简化形式为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">p</mi><mtext>foot</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">p</mi><mtext>hip</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>st</mtext></msub><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">v</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">v</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">v</mi><mtext>des</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{p}_{\\text{foot}} = \\boldsymbol{p}_{\\text{hip}} + \\frac{T_{\\text{st}}}{2}\\,\\boldsymbol{v} + k(\\boldsymbol{v} - \\boldsymbol{v}_{\\text{des}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6886em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">p</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">foot</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9636em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\">p</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">hip</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">st</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.037em;\">v</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.037em;\">v</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.037em;\">v</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">des</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>st</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{st}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">st</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为支撑时长，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">v</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold-italic\">v</mi><mtext>des</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\boldsymbol{v}, \\boldsymbol{v}_{\\text{des}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.037em;\">v</span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord boldsymbol\" style=\"margin-right:0.037em;\">v</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">des</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为当前与期望速度，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 为反馈增益。它把&quot;往速度方向多迈一步以稳住身体&quot;这一平衡直觉显式化，是连接步态与平衡的桥梁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"静态步态与动态步态的分野\">静态步态与动态步态的分野</h2><p>步态的根本分界是<strong>静态稳定 vs 动态稳定</strong>。静态步态（如四足爬行）任何瞬间重心投影都落在支撑多边形内，停在任一时刻都不会倒，慢但极稳，适合崎岖地形精细落足。动态步态（trot、bound、双足行走奔跑）则允许重心瞬时跑出支撑区，靠运动中的动量与后续落足把身体&quot;接住&quot;——它更快、更省能，但任一时刻冻结都会摔倒，必须有连续的平衡控制兜底。</p>\n<p>这个分野决定了控制复杂度的天壤之别。静态步态几乎只需几何规划；动态步态必须实时调控全身动量、预测未来落足，这正是 <a href=\"balance-dynamic-stability\">平衡与动态稳定</a> 与 <a href=\"../control/whole-body-mpc\">全身控制与 MPC</a> 要解决的问题。生物学给的提示是：动物随速度自动切换步态以最小化能耗，机器人也越来越多地用学习方法自动发现这种切换（见 <a href=\"../control/learning-locomotion\">学习驱动运动控制</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"步态调度-把相位写成可执行的状态机\">步态调度：把相位写成可执行的状态机</h2><p>参数化之后，步态要落到一台每毫秒更新一次的控制器上，最直接的实现是<strong>相位状态机</strong>：给每条腿一个相位变量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi_i \\in [0,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>ϕ</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dot{\\phi}_i = 1/T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1257em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9313em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0556em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 均匀推进，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\phi_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 落在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,\\beta)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 判为支撑相、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>β</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[\\beta,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 判为摆动相。四条腿的相位由固定偏移错开，就复现出不同步态——trot 给对角腿同相、其余差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span>；crawl 则四腿依次差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.25</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>下表把几种步态的相位偏移与占空比写成可直接配置的量。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步态</th>\n<th>相位偏移（FL/FR/RL/RR）</th>\n<th>占空比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>腾空相</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>crawl</td>\n<td>0 / 0.5 / 0.75 / 0.25</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0.75</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;0.75</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.75</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>trot</td>\n<td>0 / 0.5 / 0.5 / 0</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>pace</td>\n<td>0 / 0.5 / 0 / 0.5</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>bound</td>\n<td>0 / 0 / 0.5 / 0.5</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>有</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>状态机只管&quot;何时支撑、何时摆动&quot;，至于支撑相该出多大力、摆动相的足端走什么曲线，则分别交给 <a href=\"../control/force-compliant-locomotion\">力控与柔顺运动</a> 与摆动轨迹生成。把步态抽象成相位的好处是可平滑切换：改变 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 或相位偏移时按时间插值，机器人就能从 crawl 渐变到 trot，而非在某一瞬间硬跳步态导致失稳。这也解释了为何学习方法能顺带学出步态切换——它本质上是在学一组随速度连续变化的相位参数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>腿要兼顾支撑与摆动，机构拓扑决定工作空间与可输出力，驱动方式决定响应带宽与抗冲击。</li>\n<li>准直驱与 SEA 等设计提升关节透明度，是后续力控与柔顺运动的硬件前提。</li>\n<li>步态由占空比、相位偏移、摆动轨迹三组参数刻画，占空比是否过半划出静/动态分界。</li>\n<li>Raibert 落足点法则把&quot;朝速度方向多迈一步&quot;的平衡直觉显式化，连接步态与平衡。</li>\n<li>静态步态始终稳定但慢，动态步态快而省能却需连续平衡控制兜底。</li>\n<li>动物随速度自动换步态以省能，这一现象正被学习方法在机器人上复现。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"腿足机构与步态","id":"腿足机构与步态"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"腿的机械拓扑与驱动","id":"腿的机械拓扑与驱动"},{"level":2,"text":"步态参数化：占空比、相位与摆动轨迹","id":"步态参数化-占空比-相位与摆动轨迹"},{"level":2,"text":"静态步态与动态步态的分野","id":"静态步态与动态步态的分野"},{"level":2,"text":"步态调度：把相位写成可执行的状态机","id":"步态调度-把相位写成可执行的状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"定位与里程计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/foundations/localization-odometry"},"next":{"title":"平衡与动态稳定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/legged-mobile-robots/legged/balance-dynamic-stability"}}